| M2 | screenshot+highlights | S3 | where the share button and the absence entry are | brief |
| M3 | video 40 s | S1 | Dana's empty help desk on Friday | brief |

## Accessibility and inclusion

reading level: band E · captions on video: yes · colour never the only signal · alternatives for learners without sharing rights: practice calendar plus a note to IT · pace options: replay in S1, step-by-step M2 in S3

